{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Lap Racing is a game developed for car, engine, racing, and speed enthusiasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBJECTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set the best possible lap time on challenging tracks and dominate the global track rankings!\u00a0Challenge your skills and have fun driving street cars on detailed circuits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines realism with a fun driving feel, where each vehicle has its own physics and handling, accurately replicating:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamics impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire friction on the ground.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of cars, from popular models to high-performance sports cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various circuits, including go-kart tracks and race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed cockpit view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car's appearance with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window tint</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase car performance with mechanical parts such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbochargers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight reduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, push your limits, and prove that you're the fastest on the track!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293060?t=1771811773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293060?t=1771811773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293060/4b36d51ed5f474324e3daf77d3d5b0955e33214b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771811773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293060/4b36d51ed5f474324e3daf77d3d5b0955e33214b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771811773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Lap Racing is a game developed for car, engine, racing, and speed enthusiasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBJECTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set the best possible lap time on challenging tracks and dominate the global track rankings!\u00a0Challenge your skills and have fun driving street cars on detailed circuits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines realism with a fun driving feel, where each vehicle has its own physics and handling, accurately replicating:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamics impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire friction on the ground.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of cars, from popular models to high-performance sports cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various circuits, including go-kart tracks and race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed cockpit view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car's appearance with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window tint</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase car performance with mechanical parts such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbochargers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight reduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, push your limits, and prove that you're the fastest on the track!</p>","developers":["Black Bull Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293060/header.jpg?t=1771811773","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Fast Lap Racing","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><